            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.9.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Codex: credits reported with usage now appear immediately. Runic only tries a separate credit lookup when the usage response has no balance, and an optional web dashboard failure no longer triggers duplicate refreshes.</li>
<li>Credits: providers with credit support show the reported balance, or 0 with an unavailable note while a balance cannot be retrieved. Providers without credit support hide the field. Fetch errors no longer replace the balance in the menu.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
